            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 16.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inni ammalle sorio gubani, ta aada Seera Musa gula guyya jila ch'ufa baasu malani, baase. Guyya Sabatotifi guyya jila baatitifi guyya jila sadeeni woga ganna tanale — jila Qit'a bukho inqamne, jila gaafa mid'aani murani, ammalle jila Hoosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seera abbaani isaa Daudini kaye gula, inni qaaloleefi worra Lawi, ka qaalole sirbaafi huji keesa qarqaaru, huji worra ta guyya ch'ufa iti qoode. Inni ammalle worra Mana Waaqa eegu huji gargari qoodeefi, huji guyya ch'ufa ta balbala eegani iti kenne, seera Daudi namicha Waaqa kaani gula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri seera Daudini qaaloleefi worra Lawiti kenne, ka waan maneeni keesati wolkayanitifi waan d'ibilee tokole iraa ingorre aka dansaa jabeese guute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
